WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.440
Shigeno

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.440
Shigeno

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:18.290
<b><b>Join the Baseball Team!
All Comers Welcome!</b></b>

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.060
All right, done!

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.250
Oho! "All comers welcome!"

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.030
You sure are motivated, aren't ya?

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.540
Of course I am.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.140
The day of the entrance ceremony
is the most important.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.210
I want to attract as many 
new students as possible.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:36.860
Daigo! Come eat your breakfast!

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.690
You'll be late for school!

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.980
Coming! Breakfast, breakfast...

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.820
I'm off!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.960
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.960
<b>Shigeno Daigo</b>

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:43.800
<b>The Infamous New Members</b>

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.470
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.470
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.470
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:48.430
<b>Entrance</b>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:48.430
<b>Ceremony</b>

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.430
Aw crap. First day and I overslept...

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.650
<i>Over the next three years,
you will be devoting yourself</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.400
<i>to your studies and
to your sporting pursuits.</i>

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.490
Oh, here they all are.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:58.330
Hm, where's my seat?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:58.740
Hey!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.960
Are you a new student?!

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.900
Oh, hey, pal. Where's my class sitting?
I don't know which class I'm in yet.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:10.020
Wh-What?! First, you waltz in late,
and then you address a teacher like that?!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.500
Oh, you're a teacher? My bad, man.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.730
What's your name?

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:18.910
How did a boy like you manage to get
into this prestigious school? Answer me!

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.370
Kamei-sensei!

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.350
Your seat is in the middle 
of the first row! Hurry!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:25.220
'Kay, gotcha. Thanks a bunch.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.700
What's wrong with that student?! 
No way in hell is he right for this school...

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.230
He got in on a sports scholarship.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.940
A sports scholarship?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.210
He's here to bolster the baseball team
and its depleted roster.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.660
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.660
<b>Nishina Akira</b>

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.520
His name is Nishina Akira.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.620
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.620
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.620
<b>Fuurin Academy Private Middle School</b>

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.120
Bow! Goodbye!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.080
Goodbye!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.080
Oh, I forgot.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:53.940
From today, you're free to go check out
the various clubs and teams.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.750
Think hard about which you want to join
and make a decision within the next two weeks.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.710
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.460
M-My name is—

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.420
We did introductions earlier.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:05.810
Huh?

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:06.420
Let's go.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.430
Class is over?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.640
I guess I'll go round up the others, too.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.640
All right! Club time! Club time!

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.480
C'mon, people! Get outta our way.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.830
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.830
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.830
<b>Baseball Team</b>

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.790
Wait, what?! Are you serious, Mutsuko?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.790
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.790
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.790
<b>Baseball Team</b>

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.880
Yup. Totally serious.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:39.250
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:39.250
<b>Sakura Mutsuko</b>

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.910
Our adviser, Yamaguchi-sensei, said
a whole bunch of first-years are joining us.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:42.370
Now we finally won't be so short on players!

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.220
Aw man, really?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.180
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.180
<b>Kandori Seira</b>

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:49.910
I'm in trouble, then. If some boys who
can play join, I'll lose my starting spot.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.240
'Sup.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.350
Hey.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.310
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.310
<b>Sagara Tao</b>

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.310
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.310
<b>Sawa Yayoi</b>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:57.650
Hey, Mutsuko, are you sure you wanna 
let those guys play on our field?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:58.270
What?

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.570
Give us a grounder!

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:06.430
Idiot!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.120
Hey, you! What are you doing?!

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.560
We don't maintain this field so 
you can mess it up with your games!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.800
This field's reserved for the team!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.630
For the team, you say?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:28.100
Try again. This is a <i>baseball</i> field.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.540
You girls are on the softball team, right?

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.270
We're the baseball team.

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.980
You got a problem with
girls playing baseball?

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.940
You've got to be kidding me.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:45.610
I heard there were only six players left on
the team after the majority quit last year,

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:50.570
but I didn't expect the Fuurin baseball team
to be a straight-up girls' side.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:57.630
No wonder they went out and headhunted
the best players from the Nanyou Lions.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.830
Nanyou? That's a super-strong club.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.560
If it's the <i>Lions</i>...

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.590
S-So <i>you're</i> the new recruits 
everyone's talking about?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:11.720
Exactly. We all got sports scholarships
to come to this weak school.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:16.550
Good for you, huh? Your school 
just became a powerhouse overnight.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:19.730
If you girls are lucky, you might
play outfield, or become managers.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.740
No way! I joined because
I thought I'd get to play in games!

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:26.240
I won't let first-years hijack our team!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.200
Where's our team room?

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.910
Let's get changed and start practice.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.250
Hold on.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:40.210
You haven't done the paperwork to join,
and I haven't given permission for anything.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:44.170
Permission? And who the
hell do you think <i>you</i> are?

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.670
I'm Sakura Mutsuko, the vice-captain.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:53.740
Besides, didn't they teach the Nanyou Lions
how to speak to senior players politely?

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.850
Manners aren't just for
the baseball field, either...

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.640
Good job!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:02.560
Don't touch me! You're just the vice-captain!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.800
Wait, does this mean the captain's
a girl, too? Gimme a break...

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.560
What?!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.240
What the heck is this?!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.570
<b>Join the
baseball
team!</b>

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.200
All
comers
welcome!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.110
<i>I'll be your big sis and
teach you everything!</i>

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.950
I'll be your big sis
and teach you
everything ♥

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:14.320
I'll be your big sis
and teach you
everything ♥

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.370
My stupid sister!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.200
I'll be your big sis
and teach you
everything ♥

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.200
I'll be your big sis
and teach you
everything ♥

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.120
Are you guys actually interested 
in joining the baseball team?

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.580
So that's the team room.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.390
My name's Shigeno Daigo! I'm in Class 2-C,
and I'm captain of the Fuurin baseball team...

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.550
Oh, I guess you don't need
to know what class I'm in.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.360
Anyone interested in joining, 
write your name and class here.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:38.820
And if you put down any previous
experience, and the position you're best at...

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.070
If you don't have one,
just say where you want to—

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.890
We're changing, so don't open the door.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.240
Huh?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:54.210
Dude, seriously? First, it's all girls,
then the captain comes out and he's a shrimp!

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:57.150
This team's so weak,
it could be in an anime.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.470
By the way, Nishina,
when's Coach gonna get here?

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.920
He said he had to wrap
stuff up with the Lions first.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:05.630
It'll be another week or so.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.590
Sports scholarships?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.780
Yes, all five of them played 
for the Nanyou Lions.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.730
Nanyou?! That famous school?

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:17.330
Yeah! That's why they're so full of themselves
and act like they own the place!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.970
They said us girls should become managers.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.060
They think we stink.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.360
First impressions are key, Daigo! 
They didn't show us any respect.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.580
As captain, you need to take them to task!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.820
All right, let's do this!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.360
Yeah!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.360
Let's go!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.620
Okay, start off with
five laps of base running!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.330
And then Warm-up A!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.990
Roger!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.200
Hey! Why didn't you say anything?!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.990
They just started practice 
without even saying a word!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.750
Mutsuko. Please take care of
anyone else who shows up to join.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.260
Huh? Ah, right. Go give 'em
a dressing-down, captain!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.180
No. I'm going to go join in with their routine.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.530
What the hell?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.880
Daigo!

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:09.880
Well, I didn't expect much.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.910
I mean, Daigo confronting
guys like that? Please.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.840
It's stuff like this that makes them cocky.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.570
"I'll be your big sis"?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.780
They didn't even look at that.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.640
Oh, true.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:26.140
Anyway, up to now, it's just been us, 
so it didn't matter who we had as captain.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.920
But maybe it's time we rethought
who fills that role. Right, Mutsuko?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:46.140
Yay, I win! I did it! Huh?

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:48.680
Moron. It wasn't a race.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.110
And anyway, don't just join in with our warm-up.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:55.470
Oh, I'm sorry. I just wanted to experience 
what a Nanyou Lions training session is like.

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:56.820
Is it okay if I join in?

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:58.780
What?

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.950
I feel like I'd learn a lot from warm-up
routines they do in strong clubs.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.300
We don't do anything special.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.910
That's fine, too!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.630
If I train with you guys, 
I'll see how good you are.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.290
Ow.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.000
What was that for?!

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.090
So you finally snapped, Captain Shrimpy.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:29.600
I can't stand your fake friendliness
when us first-years are mocking you.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.920
See how good we are, my ass! Don't try 
to be the bigger person when you suck!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:37.530
When we were with the Lions,
skill was king! Age didn't matter!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.990
Once you're on the field,
the best player calls the shots!

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:43.450
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.770
Did they do something?

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:45.340
No.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.400
Listen up!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:50.370
Once Coach and some useful new 
players come in, you'll be benched!

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:54.770
If you don't want first-years talking
to you like they're on your level,

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:58.630
maybe you should just quit, Mr. <i>Senior</i>.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.580
All right, time for some stretches!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.070
Okay!

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:03.930
I agree!

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.230
Just because someone's born a year earlier

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.850
doesn't mean you should kowtow to them
if they have no skill and zero drive.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.570
Like you say, on the field,
skill's the thing that matters.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:17.820
So we'll see where everyone's at.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.530
It's not fair to talk someone down 
without even knowing their skill level.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:26.340
Interesting. Then, let's see
what "skills" you got, shall we?

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.990
If you have any, that is.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:36.460
Since we're showing off our skills, 
our only option is to play a game.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.490
A game?!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.920
Are you serious, Daigo?!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:43.270
Totally.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:08.390
If this is all of you, let's begin already.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.910
Yeah, let's get to it.

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:16.330
I can only see a future where you guys are
packing your bags, bawling your eyes out.

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:22.550
All right! Team First-Years will bat last.
The girls' team will bat first.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:26.760
Hey! We're not just girls! 
Call us Team Upperclassmen!

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:29.470
That guy's so damn irritating...

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.430
Is this really wise?

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:36.400
If we lose, they'll mock us for all eternity.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.360
We've got no choice.
They said skill decides everything.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.320
Unless we show them our skills and
beat them, they won't listen to us.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.450
But they're ex-Lions. <i>Lions</i>!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.130
It's fine, it's fine.

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:54.310
No matter how good their club was,
they were grade schoolers up until recently.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:58.290
If you consider how much progress 
we made this year, we'll have no—

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.730
Ah...

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.840
I guess that explains the attitude.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:15.040
All right, we're ready. Play ball!

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.730
Don't start crying now.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.940
Oh crap, I'm late.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.940
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.940
<b>Kandori Seira</b>

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.660
<b>Join the
baseball
team!</b>

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.660
All
comers
welcome!

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:26.440
I bet the team room is 
full of new recruits—

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.940
Huh? Nobody's here.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.690
Strike two!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.800
That's fast. Wonder what speed it reaches.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.510
About 110 kmph, I'd say.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:45.470
I'm bored.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.390
As if a girl could even graze this!

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:57.630
Out!

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.450
Hey, now. She actually made contact.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:13:59.230
Lucky hit.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:13:59.990
Dang.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.190
So close.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.650
Guess they do have eyes.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:11.700
Strike.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.700
What? That was way high!

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:14.800
Shigeno-kun!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.710
Tanba-san, you're late.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.420
Sorry. I had to do some student council stuff.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:22.950
You having a game to welcome the first-years?

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:26.050
"Welcome"? Yeah, I guess we are.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.820
Third!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.480
Out!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:34.350
They're good.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.280
This year's first-years are amazing!

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.350
I'm so excited!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.610
Two outs!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:48.400
<i>What is this? What's with this team?</i>

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.360
<i>They're just girls. How can they...</i>

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.290
<i>...hit my fastballs?!</i>

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.310
Three outs!

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.420
Rats, so close!

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.380
Time to switch sides.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:15.350
Aw... Three up, three down, huh?

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.060
<b>Upperclassmen</b>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.060
<b>Brats</b>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.480
This is bad. They only had three fielders.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.010
We can't give up any runs, Mutsuko!

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:25.940
Hey, don't put pressure on me! I haven't
taken the mound in a game before!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.820
Daigo...

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.420
It's fine. I know you can do it.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.240
Just look at my mitt and throw, okay?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.290
Okay!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.170
All right, let's lock this down!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.480
No need to hold back! Make 'em afraid!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.170
Yeah!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.630
Timeout!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.590
Timeout! Timeout!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.030
It's hard playing without an umpire.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:58.560
I can take over.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.710
Who's this old geezer?

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:05.200
I'm a third-year, president of the student
council, and a member of this team!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.230
And you!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.030
A third-year?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.690
What kind of attitude is that?!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.440
So he's their only actual senior left?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.440
You better watch your mouth! You listening?

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:12.660
Play!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.210
Mutsuko, fight!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.210
Bring it!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.810
Strike!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.520
Can he not?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.090
Nice one!

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.900
You got this, Mutsuko!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.190
Full power, and that's all she's got?

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:51.500
Hey, you can close your eyes! 
It's like a bonus stage!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.410
Third!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.830
All right!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.220
Damn!

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:01.980
Don't worry!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.040
You don't say it to yourself!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.190
Follow it up!

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:07.610
Sawa-san, you don't have to stick to first!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.740
The next one's going left, 
so second'll be wide open.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.920
'Kay.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:12.980
Seriously?

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.270
That's a free steal for the runner!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.470
Play!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.310
Well, I won't say no to that.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.200
Back!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.590
Welcome home, master.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.150
Out!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.860
One out! One out!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.050
What are you doing,
falling for a pickoff play?!

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.030
Sorry.

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:41.450
<i>They pretended not to care about first
 and secretly put out a sign.</i>

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.160
<i>That rat likes to play dirty, huh?</i>

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.290
That's there to be hit!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.430
Safe!

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:55.310
Yeah!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:58.220
Wait, he only just made it with that hit?

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.930
That shortstop is good.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.060
One out! One out!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.360
I thought, with all these girls, you were
just playing at being a baseball team,

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.730
but you're actually not horrible.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.690
Oh? Should we stop, then?

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:18.610
If you show your seniors some respect,
we won't insist on finishing this game.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.940
Shut your yap.

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:24.610
We're going to build the strongest Fuurin
team ever seen, starting with our year!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.920
You annoying upperclassmen 
are just in our way!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:51.060
Out! Three outs! Change sides!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.820
Yeah! Nice double play!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.940
Let's keep it up!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:55.960
Looking good!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:19:00.640
You're probably wondering why you're not 
getting any good hits. I'll explain it to you.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:04.060
I can tell just by looking
that you're all good.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:07.450
But up until recently,
you've been playing little league.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:11.410
The biggest difference between 
little league and middle school baseball...

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.710
The thing you guys just can't deal with...

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.590
...is breaking balls.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.890
<b>Upperclassmen</b>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.890
<b>Brats</b>

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:23.600
You got this!

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.810
<i>Breaking balls?</i>

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.230
All right, bring it!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.650
Knock it out of the park, Daigo!

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.770
This inning's ours!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:36.510
<i>These guys... are treating me like a child!</i>

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:39.820
Ball!

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:47.410
<i>I don't need you to tell me there are breaking
balls in middle school! I already know!</i>

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.000
Oh my.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.960
What happened?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:53.960
What the hell?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.800
You don't have to try so hard 
to throw a breaking ball.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:02.340
You're probably not used to the
balls we use in middle school yet,

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:06.050
and I guess you only practiced pitching
breaking balls for fun, right?

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:10.020
Don't worry about that stuff.
Just show me what you're good at.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.870
I wanna see if you've got the
firepower to become our ace.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.150
<i>How dare you talk down to me?!</i>

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.200
<i>Who do you think I am, shrimp?!</i>

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:20.780
Ball!

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.970
Too much power means
you can't swing your arm.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.240
Don't rush the pitch.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.490
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.980
Seriously? That's an
inside-the-park home run, isn't it?

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:48.080
What are you <i>doing</i>, shortstop?! Go get it!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.630
You've got to be kidding me!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.270
Are you like this in all your games?!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:58.580
Disrespect us all you want, but I will
not tolerate you disrespecting baseball!

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.740
That was impressive.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.450
Daigo...

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.340
So what shall we do? Want to continue?

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:14.290
With your experience,
you must have noticed by now.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:18.500
You prejudged us and assumed we sucked.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:23.030
We don't have the numbers, but our
third-years last year were pretty good,

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:25.170
and together with our coach,
they taught us a lot.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:28.200
And while you dismissed them
as losers because they're girls,

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:31.780
their training regime was the same
as the boys the entire time.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:34.850
They can go toe-to-toe with your average boy.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:37.770
Especially the two in the middle,
Tao and Sawa-san,

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.400
who were regulars for Yokohama Little,
and made it to Nationals.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:43.860
Yokohama Little?!

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:52.330
Nishina, you could make a good pitcher.

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:54.790
The rest of you looked good out there, too.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.640
I won't tell you to kowtow 
to us upperclassmen,

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:03.340
nor do I want to us to pretend 
we're the best of friends.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.800
The more we compete with each other, 
the stronger this team will get.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:10.690
This battle between us isn't over.
It's only just begun.

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:15.020
Welcome to the Fuurin baseball team.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:06.640
All right! Along with Nishina and his gang,
we got two more girls from Yokohama Little!

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:09.010
The new team's finally coming together!

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:11.340
Daigo, I'm not playing pitcher anymore!

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.840
Huh? Why are you all mad, Mutsuko?

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:17.970
It's these new members!
I don't think I can go on like this!

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:19.680
Hey, come on...

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:22.890
Next time: "That Catcher's Got a Sharp Tongue."

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>That Catcher's Got a Sharp Tongue</b>

00:24:22.890 --> 00:24:25.020
Run to the stage of your dreams!
